    "alert_id": "P006_NO_PLAN",
    "title": "No clinician assessment or plan documented",
    "message": "No assessment or plan was documented for this visit. Guidelines require screening for developing signs and symptoms at follow-up for patients on TDF and DTG, including renal function monitoring and hyperglycemia screening. The patient has a rising creatinine trend and no blood glucose screening, both of which require actionable plans. Documentation of the plan ensures guideline-recommended monitoring and safety assessments are addressed.",
